AQ7kNvwGmqZ8u&_nc_oc=AdqlSYc6doiwjpoetKlAMiO2UUmkq-DZzvdAuf1wBhiGHPdIiCxac6y7ENYLunA0Vv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQONDPdrluLtAr18EmKkQeaPGRE1jdv9QOjA4DNfOUHm-g&oe=6AC1142D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2603779376744141", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_2603779380077474_4666028558694902990_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WAm0JiavNZ8Q7kNvwE0XNAF&_nc_oc=AdqluyQPV3n-O5lqtCRk__yxDtW0mvgC95Ckw43EYqkM4fw--Vpu-BKWSxQwwxty3j4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN6gD2roJgK8XL01LO-9XFKDqqwEt3rqJUc2m8yNkbTWg&oe=6AC12EC3"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1978053772849249", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1978053776182582_2907804030611711830_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aPZlG23sBCgQ7kNvwG--EH6&_nc_oc=AdpOEKrpUVmf7qT-WbGKhtlw294e0Oth8mQkKrL-P_gTBIXSZPRsAczb5DN8zZDi6pw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMDkFUIwte0Nw02G6yZ5njx538A0vLBeScVKJQYmAspXQ&oe=6AC10B53"}, {"file_name": "cap2.png", "id": "2479962425803629", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_2479962429136962_4316597219347806467_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C44rmT4P1sQQ7kNvwGWlP-o&_nc_oc=AdqFRM3zJJo13Yb6cpbmrry9oDdQgLGF2k5AXvk9BIdg8Io8n6htCPzN6suVZ8nXLls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOt0bYY1Rl0euvBX7eihnCBGO8Gj0u6gfxc9_Hzugk5IQ&oe=6AC12026"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "bodyPress", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Your body writes a journal every day \u2014 BodyPress reads it.\n\nBodyPress turns your health data into a daily first-person story. Instead of staring at numbers and charts, you read a warm, insightful narrative written as if your body is speaking to you \u2014 revealing patterns and correlations you'd otherwise miss.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f HEALTH NOTICE\nBodyPress is a general wellness and self-reflection tool. It is NOT a medical device and does NOT provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for any questions about your health or a medical condition. Never disregard or delay professional medical advice because of anything you read in this app. In an emergency, contact your doctor or emergency services immediately.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\u2728 WHY BODYPRESS\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\nMost health apps show dashboards of disconnected metrics. BodyPress takes a storytelling approach: it gathers data from your sensors, wearables, and environment, then uses AI to weave it into one cohesive narrative. Poor sleep before an elevated resting heart rate? Cleaner-air days with fewer steps? Your body knows \u2014 and now it can tell you.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83c\udfaf KEY FEATURES\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83d\udcd6 AI DAILY JOURNAL\n\u2022 First-person narratives from real sensor data\n\u2022 Headline, mood, summary, and full story\n\n\ud83d\udcca DATA COLLECTION\n\u2022 Health: steps, distance, calories, heart rate, HRV, sleep, workouts\n\u2022 Environment: temperature, air quality (AQI), UV, humidity, weather\n\u2022 Locatio", "short_description": "BodyPress turns your health data into a daily first-person story. Instead of staring at numbers and charts, you read a warm, insightful narrative written as if your body is speaking to you \u2014 revealing patterns and correlations you'd otherwise miss."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer